298 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 183 0 R
/E (completed. The simulation represented a startup-style working environment and introduced a fictional company context referred to as Shiptivitas. The work was designed around product-focused software engineering, where technical development was connected with user needs and product improvement. Instead of focusing only on coding, the simulation also involved understanding user behaviour, support feedback, usage metrics, and feature ideas. This combination gave an overview of how software engineering can work together with product and analytics activities in a startup environment.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
