/P 183 0 R
/E (platform. The simulation offered an opportunity to understand the type of work carried out by a product-focused engineering team in a startup-style environment. During the simulation, the work focused on a Kanban-based productivity feature for freight shippers. The project involved designing, implementing, and evaluating a workflow feature while also considering user behaviour, support feedback, product usage data, and possible improvements to user engagement. Through this experience, practical exposure was gained across frontend development, backend development, analytics, and product thinking.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [12]
>>
