311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (The scope of the project covered several connected areas of software and product development. On the frontend side, the work included the development and extension of a Kanban-style task management interface with drag-and-drop interactions. On the backend side, Node.js was used to persist changes related to task status and priority. The scope also included analysing product usage data with SQL to understand daily active users and task activity. In addition, the project involved considering customer support feedback and user behaviour when forming feature hypotheses and recommendations. Therefore, the scope was not limited to web development alone and included frontend development, backend development, analytics, communication, customer support awareness, and product strategy.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
