798 0 obj
<<
/Title (The project methodology involved first understanding the workflow and productivity requirement represented in the simulation, followed by designing and extending the Kanban-style task management feature. The implementation focused on enabling drag-and-drop task reordering and movement between workflow stages. Backend integration was then used to persist task status and priority changes. After the development work, product usage data was analysed with SQL to identify user activity patterns such as daily active users and task activity. User behaviour and support feedback were considered along with the metrics, and the findings were used to form feature hypotheses and recommendations. This approach combined implementation, data analysis, and product thinking rather than treating the project as a coding task alone.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 719 0 R
>>
endobj
